                "text": "Recently, I joined @RepGregPence in a letter to @CMSGov opposing President Biden\u2019s proposed staffing rule for nursing homes. Piling on regulations in the midst of a workforce shortage only makes it more difficult for skilled nursing care facilities to serve patients. https://t.co/KhQdrkzS4N",
