                "text": "While I welcome the end of the Public Health Emergency, the Biden administration must work with Congress to ensure patients, especially those in rural areas, can access the health care services they need. \n\nI asked Secretary Becerra about this today \u2935\ufe0f https://t.co/hU7GRQAKAa",
