                "text": "Patients face too much uncertainty and lack information about the cost of their health care.\n\nWe must work together to empower consumers with information to help them avoid unnecessary, unexpected costs.\n\nWatch my statement at today's @waysandmeansgop hearing.\u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/QMDoEjbEWM",
