                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Happy Rural Health Day! With 58 Critical Access Hospitals and over 100 Rural Health Clinics, #NE03 is a national leader in rural health care. Supporting the work of rural providers and promoting health care access for our communities is one of my top priorities in Congress. https://t.co/psVBvRhEvD",
